<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2006/08/15 (火) 21:32:56 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:happy@ex.sakura.ne.jp">Ｋ．伊藤</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200608152213256_log_k_ito.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200608152213256"></font>
